    "Coach uses your question and saved set summaries. Apple Intelligence may process them on this iPhone or through Apple's Private Cloud Compute. Camera frames and raw pose points are never included." : {
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coach uses your question and saved set summaries. Apple Intelligence may process them on this iPhone or through Apple's Private Cloud Compute. Camera frames and raw pose points are never included."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coach utilise ta question et les résumés de tes séries enregistrées. Apple Intelligence peut les traiter sur cet iPhone ou via Private Cloud Compute d’Apple. Les images de la caméra et les points de pose bruts ne sont jamais inclus."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coach usa tu pregunta y los resúmenes de tus series guardadas. Apple Intelligence puede procesarlos en este iPhone o mediante Private Cloud Compute de Apple. Nunca se incluyen imágenes de la cámara ni puntos de postura sin procesar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answered by Apple Intelligence on this device." : {
