    "Hip hinge is how much the angle between your torso and thigh closed from the starting position, as seen by the camera. Use it only to compare your own sets from the same view." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La flexion de hanche indique de combien l’angle entre ton buste et ta cuisse s’est fermé depuis la position de départ, vu par la caméra. Sers-t’en seulement pour comparer tes propres séries filmées sous le même angle."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hip hinge is how much the angle between your torso and thigh closed from the starting position, as seen by the camera. Use it only to compare your own sets from the same view."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hip hinge is how much the angle between your torso and thigh closed from the starting position, as seen by the camera. Use it only to compare your own sets from the same view."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La flexión de cadera indica cuánto se ha cerrado el ángulo entre tu torso y tu muslo desde la posición inicial, según lo ve la cámara. Úsalo solo para comparar tus propias series grabadas desde el mismo ángulo."
          }
        }
