    "Measured set summaries are saved on this iPhone so you can review previous sets. They include which measured patterns each set showed, so Finn can point out your most frequent one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les résumés des séries mesurées restent sur cet iPhone pour que tu puisses revoir tes séries précédentes. Ils notent les tendances mesurées sur chaque série, pour que Finn puisse te signaler la plus fréquente."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Measured set summaries are saved on this iPhone so you can review previous sets. They include which measured patterns each set showed, so Finn can point out your most frequent one."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Measured set summaries are saved on this iPhone so you can review previous sets. They include which measured patterns each set showed, so Finn can point out your most frequent one."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los resúmenes de las series medidas se guardan en este iPhone para que puedas revisar tus series anteriores. Incluyen qué patrones medidos mostró cada serie, para que Finn pueda señalarte el más frecuente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
