          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finn adapts its advice to you: rest between sets, a lighter day after a short night or a heavy day, and your heart rate from Apple Watch. Each tip says which data it uses. Nothing leaves this iPhone, and Finn works fully without it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn adapte ses conseils à toi : repos entre les séries, journée plus légère après une nuit courte ou une grosse journée, et ta fréquence cardiaque depuis l’Apple Watch. Chaque conseil dit quelles données il utilise. Rien ne quitte cet iPhone, et Finn marche très bien sans."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn adapts its advice to you: rest between sets, a lighter day after a short night or a heavy day, and your heart rate from Apple Watch. Each tip says which data it uses. Nothing leaves this iPhone, and Finn works fully without it."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn adapts its advice to you: rest between sets, a lighter day after a short night or a heavy day, and your heart rate from Apple Watch. Each tip says which data it uses. Nothing leaves this iPhone, and Finn works fully without it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn adapta sus consejos a ti: descanso entre series, días más ligeros tras una noche corta o un día intenso, y tu ritmo cardíaco desde Apple Watch. Cada consejo indica qué datos utiliza. Nada sale de este iPhone, y Finn funciona perfectamente sin él."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finn adapts what it says after each set. Pick one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn adapte ce qu’il te dit après chaque série. Choisis une réponse."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn adapts what it says after each set. Pick one."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn adapts what it says after each set. Pick one."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn adapta lo que te dice después de cada serie. Elige una."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finn can read your heart rate, recovery, sleep, recent workouts, age, weight and height from Health to adapt rest times and suggest lighter days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn peut lire dans Santé ta fréquence cardiaque, ta récupération, ton sommeil, tes derniers entraînements, ton âge, ton poids et ta taille, pour adapter tes temps de repos et te proposer des jours plus légers."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn can read your heart rate, recovery, sleep, recent workouts, age, weight and height from Health to adapt rest times and suggest lighter days."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn can read your heart rate, recovery, sleep, recent workouts, age, weight and height from Health to adapt rest times and suggest lighter days."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn puede leer en Salud tu ritmo cardíaco, recuperación, sueño, entrenamientos recientes, edad, peso y altura para adaptar los tiempos de descanso y sugerir días más ligeros."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finn can't read your history right now. Unlock your iPhone and ask again." : {
      "comment" : "Siri, when the history file cannot be read",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn ne peut pas lire ton historique pour l’instant. Déverrouille ton iPhone et redemande."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn can't read your history right now. Unlock your iPhone and ask again."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn can't read your history right now. Unlock your iPhone and ask again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn no puede leer tu historial ahora mismo. Desbloquea tu iPhone e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finn can’t see you. Step into view or add light" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn ne te voit pas. Entre dans le cadre ou ajoute de la lumière"
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn can’t see you. Step into view or add light"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn can’t see you. Step into view or add light"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn no te ve. Entra en el encuadre o añade luz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finn checks %@ form from the side only. It saw you about %lld° from side-on, so it gives no form advice for this set." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Finn checks %1$@ form from the side only. It saw you about %2$lld° from side-on, so it gives no form advice for this set."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn ne contrôle la forme des %1$@ que de profil. Tu étais à environ %2$lld° du profil, donc il ne donne pas de conseil de forme sur cette série."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn checks %1$@ form from the side only. It saw you about %2$lld° from side-on, so it gives no form advice for this set."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn checks %1$@ form from the side only. It saw you about %2$lld° from side-on, so it gives no form advice for this set."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn solo comprueba la forma de %1$@ desde el lateral. Te vio a unos %2$lld° de perfil, por lo que no da consejos de forma para esta serie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
