            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn necesita al menos cuatro repeticiones medidas antes de poder mostrar una observación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finn needs no account: there is no server, nothing to sign in to, and nothing to sync." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn ne demande aucun compte : pas de serveur, rien où se connecter, rien à synchroniser."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn needs no account: there is no server, nothing to sign in to, and nothing to sync."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn needs no account: there is no server, nothing to sign in to, and nothing to sync."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn no necesita cuenta: no hay servidor, nada para iniciar sesión y nada que sincronizar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finn reads Health only if you turn on Personalize with Health: heart rate, resting heart rate, heart rate variability, VO2 max, workouts, active energy, steps, sleep, age, weight and height, to adapt its advice to you. It never writes calories or heart rate, and nothing leaves this iPhone through Finn." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn ne lit Santé que si tu actives Personnaliser avec Santé : fréquence cardiaque, fréquence cardiaque au repos, variabilité cardiaque, VO2 max, entraînements, énergie active, pas, sommeil, âge, poids et taille, pour adapter ses conseils. Il n’écrit jamais de calories ni de fréquence cardiaque, et rien ne quitte cet iPhone par Finn."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn reads Health only if you turn on Personalize with Health: heart rate, resting heart rate, heart rate variability, VO2 max, workouts, active energy, steps, sleep, age, weight and height, to adapt its advice to you. It never writes calories or heart rate, and nothing leaves this iPhone through Finn."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn reads Health only if you turn on Personalise with Health: heart rate, resting heart rate, heart rate variability, VO2 max, workouts, active energy, steps, sleep, age, weight and height, to adapt its advice to you. It never writes calories or heart rate, and nothing leaves this iPhone through Finn."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn solo lee Salud si activas Personalizar con Salud: frecuencia cardíaca, frecuencia cardíaca en reposo, variabilidad de la frecuencia cardíaca, VO2 máx, entrenamientos, energía activa, pasos, sueño, edad, peso y altura, para adaptar sus consejos a ti. Nunca escribe calorías ni frecuencia cardíaca, y nada sale de este iPhone mediante Finn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finn saw the joints clearly for only part of the set, so it made no observation." : {
      "comment" : "Siri, partly visible set",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn n’a bien vu tes articulations que sur une partie de la série, donc il ne fait pas d’observation."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn saw the joints clearly for only part of the set, so it made no observation."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn saw the joints clearly for only part of the set, so it made no observation."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn solo vio claramente las articulaciones durante parte de la serie, por lo que no realizó ninguna observación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finn saw this set only partly, so it doesn’t compare it with your earlier sets." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn n’a vu cette série qu’en partie, donc il ne la compare pas à tes séries précédentes."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn saw this set only partly, so it doesn’t compare it with your earlier sets."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn saw this set only partly, so it doesn’t compare it with your earlier sets."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn solo vio esta serie parcialmente, por lo que no la compara con tus series anteriores."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finn says the countdown, each counted rep, and when a rep is clearly faster or shorter than your first reps of the set. It uses your AirPods or other headphones when they are connected, otherwise the iPhone speaker." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn annonce le décompte, chaque répétition comptée, et te prévient quand une répétition est nettement plus rapide ou plus courte que tes premières de la série. Il passe par tes AirPods ou d’autres écouteurs s’ils sont connectés, sinon par le haut-parleur de l’iPhone."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn says the countdown, each counted rep, and when a rep is clearly faster or shorter than your first reps of the set. It uses your AirPods or other headphones when they are connected, otherwise the iPhone speaker."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn says the countdown, each counted rep, and when a rep is clearly faster or shorter than your first reps of the set. It uses your AirPods or other headphones when they are connected, otherwise the iPhone speaker."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn anuncia la cuenta atrás y cada repetición contada, y avisa si una repetición es claramente más rápida o corta que las primeras de la serie. Usa tus AirPods u otros auriculares si están conectados; si no, el altavoz del iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finn says the countdown, each rep, and short live observations, and you can tap to hear an observation, through your iPhone or headphones. Turn spoken reps off in Options. Finn does not record sound or use the microphone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn annonce le décompte, chaque répétition et de courtes observations en direct, et tu peux toucher pour écouter une observation, sur l’iPhone ou dans tes écouteurs. Tu peux couper l’annonce des répétitions dans Options. Finn n’enregistre aucun son et n’utilise pas le micro."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn says the countdown, each rep, and short live observations, and you can tap to hear an observation, through your iPhone or headphones. Turn spoken reps off in Options. Finn does not record sound or use the microphone."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn says the countdown, each rep, and short live observations, and you can tap to hear an observation, through your iPhone or headphones. Turn spoken reps off in Options. Finn does not record sound or use the microphone."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn anuncia la cuenta atrás, cada repetición y breves observaciones en directo. Puedes tocar para escuchar una observación por el iPhone o los auriculares. Puedes desactivar la voz en Opciones. Finn no graba sonido ni usa el micrófono."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finn starts the set once it sees you clearly and you hold still." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn démarre la série dès qu’il te voit bien et que tu restes immobile."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn starts the set once it sees you clearly and you hold still."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn starts the set once it sees you clearly and you hold still."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn inicia la serie apenas te ve claramente y mantienes la postura quieta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finn uses the camera to measure a supported exercise from the side. Camera frames and pose points stay on this iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn se sert de la caméra pour mesurer un exercice pris en charge, de profil. Les images et les points de pose restent sur cet iPhone."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn uses the camera to measure a supported exercise from the side. Camera frames and pose points stay on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn uses the camera to measure a supported exercise from the side. Camera frames and pose points stay on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finn usa la cámara para medir de perfil un ejercicio compatible. Las imágenes de la cámara y los puntos de postura permanecen en este iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finn · %@" : {
