    },
    "When Finn is open on your paired Apple Watch, this iPhone sends it the exercise name, the set’s progress, the rep count, live observations, and the result line. Video and pose points stay on this iPhone. The watch does not measure your movement." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quand Finn est ouvert sur ton Apple Watch jumelée, cet iPhone lui envoie le nom de l’exercice, l’avancement de la série, le nombre de répétitions, les observations en direct et la ligne de résultat. La vidéo et les points de pose restent sur cet iPhone. La montre ne mesure pas ton mouvement."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When Finn is open on your paired Apple Watch, this iPhone sends it the exercise name, the set’s progress, the rep count, live observations, and the result line. Video and pose points stay on this iPhone. The watch does not measure your movement."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When Finn is open on your paired Apple Watch, this iPhone sends it the exercise name, the set’s progress, the rep count, live observations, and the result line. Video and pose points stay on this iPhone. The watch does not measure your movement."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando Finn está abierto en tu Apple Watch emparejado, este iPhone le envía el nombre del ejercicio, el progreso de la serie, el número de repeticiones, las observaciones en directo y la línea de resultado. El video y los puntos de postura permanecen en este iPhone. La watch no mide tu movimiento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When they are connected, Finn speaks there. Otherwise it uses the iPhone speaker. You can change this in Options." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "S’ils sont connectés, Finn parle dedans. Sinon il passe par le haut-parleur de l’iPhone. Tu peux changer ça dans les Options."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When they are connected, Finn speaks there. Otherwise it uses the iPhone speaker. You can change this in Options."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When they are connected, Finn speaks there. Otherwise it uses the iPhone speaker. You can change this in Options."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando están conectados, Finn habla por ahí. De lo contrario, usa el altavoz del iPhone. Puedes cambiarlo en Opciones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you finish a session (Done, or Finish session on the first screen), Finn saves it to Apple Health as a strength training workout with its time and measured reps, never calories or heart rate, so it shows in the Fitness app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quand tu termines une séance (Terminé, ou Terminer la séance sur le premier écran), Finn l’enregistre dans Santé comme un entraînement de renforcement musculaire avec sa durée et ses répétitions mesurées, jamais de calories ni de fréquence cardiaque, pour qu’elle apparaisse dans l’app Forme."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you finish a session (Done, or Finish session on the first screen), Finn saves it to Apple Health as a strength training workout with its time and measured reps, never calories or heart rate, so it shows in the Fitness app."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you finish a session (Done, or Finish session on the first screen), Finn saves it to Apple Health as a strength training workout with its time and measured reps, never calories or heart rate, so it shows in the Fitness app."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando terminas una sesión (Terminado o Terminar la sesión en la primera pantalla), Finn la guarda en Apple Health como un entrenamiento de fuerza con su tiempo y las repeticiones medidas, nunca calorías ni frecuencia cardíaca, para que aparezca en la app Fitness."
          }
        }
      }
    },
